1
00:00:00,013 --> 00:00:02,383
(Sheldon:)Yeah, take whatever you want.

2
00:00:02,382 --> 00:00:04,552
(Leonard:)I would like to keep...

3
00:00:04,551 --> 00:00:07,321
(Leonard:)the official flag
of our apartment.

4
00:00:08,188 --> 00:00:10,518
(Sheldon:)But you don't even like flags.

5
00:00:10,523 --> 00:00:12,323
(Leonard:)Yeah, I like this one.

6
00:00:14,361 --> 00:00:16,661
(Sheldon:)But I designed it.

7
00:00:16,663 --> 00:00:19,763
(Leonard:)But you made me order it because
you were "too well-known"

8
00:00:19,766 --> 00:00:23,866
(Leonard:)in the flag community
and they'd jack up the price.

9
00:00:23,870 --> 00:00:25,200
(Sheldon:)But you don't even understand

10
00:00:25,205 --> 00:00:27,535
(Sheldon:)- its symbolism.
- Oh, I do.

11
00:00:27,540 --> 00:00:30,910
The-the field of blue
represents you being miserable,

12
00:00:30,910 --> 00:00:33,580
(Leonard:)and the lion sticking
its tongue out means

13
00:00:33,580 --> 00:00:35,450
(Leonard:)I'm happy about it.

14
00:00:38,551 --> 00:00:40,981
(Sheldon:)Come along, Amy.

15
00:00:40,987 --> 00:00:43,257
(Sheldon:)I know when I'm not wanted.

16
00:00:44,157 --> 00:00:48,257
(Amy:)I don't think you do,
but all right.

17
00:00:50,563 --> 00:00:53,193
(Bernadette:)Stuart, you cooked?

18
00:00:53,199 --> 00:00:54,829
(Howard:)How did you know it wasn't me?

19
00:00:54,834 --> 00:00:56,534
(Bernadette:)There's only three
people in this house,

20
00:00:56,536 --> 00:01:00,026
(Bernadette:)and you'd still be
my fifth guess.

